{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36770","headline":"暇日感怀因寄同院吴蜕拾遗 · 罗隐","name":"暇日感怀因寄同院吴蜕拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"璧池清秩访燕台，曾捧瀛州札翰来。\n今日二难俱大夜，当时三幅谩高才。\n戏悲槐市便便笥，狂忆樟亭满满杯。\n犹幸小兰同舍在，每因相见即衔哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36770.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36770","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}